<div class="lf-h1"><span class="h1-icon">✅</span> 答案參考（做完先睇！）</div>
<div class="lf-parent-summary"><div class="lf-ps-title">📝 答案快查</div>
<table class="lf-qt"><tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th>答案</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td style="font-size:11px">對稱圖形摺埋之後，兩邊會＿＿＿＿（一模一樣 / 唔同）。</td><td style="font-weight:900;color:var(--gold);padding:5px 10px;font-size:12px">問老師</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td style="font-size:11px">一個心形 ❤️ 左右兩半係咪對稱？</td><td style="font-weight:900;color:var(--gold);padding:5px 10px;font-size:12px">問老師</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td style="font-size:11px">正方形有幾多條對稱軸？A. 1條 B. 2條 C. 4條</td><td style="font-weight:900;color:var(--gold);padding:5px 10px;font-size:12px">問老師</td></tr>
